Z||000000||Dan87GT||12-30-1999||09:18 AM||||Are the lower and middle intake manifolds on the V6 motors painted silver at the factory? I am reassembling mine and noticed that they have been painted at some point, but didn't know if they came that way from the factory.||||reg||1
Z||000001||BOILERMAKER||12-30-1999||10:53 AM||||I am in the process of rebuilding my engine and have already put the lower manifold on.  In the process of cleaning up the middle one, I was using a wire brush (was expecting to have to repaint them) and everything came out nice and shiny silver.  I don't know too much about these, but they don't look like they were painted to me and with everything I did to clean them up I still don't think they have been painted.<P>Good question, I don't know the answer.  Just submitting what I found.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Steven||12-30-1999||02:59 PM||||My upper is painted, middle and lower are not. This is how mine came from production. ||||reg||1
